{
  "_doc": "Font map for figgenie-paper-diagram. Keys are font *keys* used in figure specs (meta.font). Each entry lists the family names it substitutes (aliases, matched case-insensitively, PDF subset prefixes like ABCDEF+ stripped), the open font files shipped in this directory, the CSS stack to declare on the root <svg>, and the license. Files are resolved relative to this directory. Families with empty `files` and a `system_files` map are not shipped: the scripts look them up in `system_font_dirs` (first matching file per weight, glob patterns allowed) and embed a subset only when `embeddable` is true (open licences). `cjk_default` is the CJK companion added automatically whenever a figure's text contains CJK characters (`script: cjk` families hold the CJK glyphs; the Latin family stays first in the stack).",
